WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
One class. Three connected views.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Launch your own easy-to-create test with Quick Launch.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Project the QR code or room name. No apps to install.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Students enter their details and join.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Everyone ready? Start the quiz.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Students answer. You follow their progress live.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:49.000
Show live activity to the class—or keep it private.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Optional: hiding the test page for more than five seconds locks the attempt.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:01:02.000
Submit answers. Check the final score and corrections.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:06.000
End the session. Results stay saved and organized.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:14.000
Review every answer. Export results your way.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:17.000
Your classroom. Connected.
